bets: Breaking down the numbers for Texas Tech, Kentucky and more","description":"Pamela Maldonado and Mark Zinno break down the best bets they see around college football for Week 12.","published":"2026-11-19T15:00:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50513003/college-football-odds-best-bets-week-12-spreads-lines-2026","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado and Mark Zinno","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"South Carolina star QB LaNorris Sellers set to play vs. No. 1 Georgia","description":"South Carolina star QB LaNorris Sellers is set to play in Saturday's game vs. No. 1 Georgia after not appearing on the injury report Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-19T03:01:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50526154/south-carolina-qb-lanorris-sellers-set-play-vs-georgia","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"NC State names NFL assistant Jason Michael as OC under Philip Rivers","published":"2026-11-19T12:21:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50524698/nc-state-names-nfl-assistant-michael-oc-rivers","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia AG asks SEC to take action against LSU's 'contempt for the rules'","description":"The Georgia Attorney General blasted LSU in a letter to SEC commissioner Greg Sankey, encouraging sanctions against the Tigers, \"up to and including expulsion.\"","published":"2026-11-19T14:06:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/story/_/id/50524054/georgia-ag-asks-sec-take-action-vs-lsu-expulsion","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach and Pete Thamel","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4905925/devan-thompkins","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devan_Thompkins"},"pick":{"pick":31,"round":1,"team":"SF","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Devan Thompkins","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devan_Thompkins","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-18T13:13:47Z","intro":"Devan Thompkins is an American college football defensive tackle for the Alabama Crimson Tide. He previously played for the USC Trojans.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Thompkins attended St. Mary's High School in Stockton, California for three years before transferring to Edison High School in Stockton for his senior year. He played basketball at St. Mary's and did not play football until his senior year at Edison. He played defensive end and tight end in high school and had nine tackles and caught three passes for 24 yards. Thompkins committed to the University of Southern California (USC) to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Thompkins played in three combined games his first two years at USC in 2022 and 2023. In 2024, he started six of 13 games and recorded 24 tackles and 1.5 sacks. In 2025, he had 31 tackles and three sacks. After the season, Thompkins entered the transfer portal."}]}}